OL,3,GNEWSATown councillors bid to buy cinema
OL,4,Asite for #1
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community cinema could be bought for
OL,7,Fjust #1 after parish councillors
OL,8,Fstepped in to try to save it.
OL,10,FReform-led Barnsley Council has
OL,11,Fcancelled a planned renovation of
OL,12,FPenistone Town Hall, home to the
OL,13,FPenistone Paramount cinema, as part of
OL,14,Fits budget review.
OL,16,FThe previous Labour administration had
OL,17,Fapproved funding for a #1.8m
OL,18,Fredevelopment of the Art Deco-style
OL,19,Fcinema.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
