OL,3,GNEWSATown councillors bid to buy cinema
OL,4,Asite for #1
OL,5,
OL,6,FTown councillors are now offering to
OL,7,Fpurchase the entire town hall building
OL,8,Ffor just #1, which they say is an
OL,9,Fappropriate price as it needs huge
OL,10,Frefurbishment. They say they can access
OL,11,Fother funding to carry out the
OL,12,Frenovation work.
